 tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a>:</b> <b>Steel</b> is the common metal used to make weapons and armor.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0012805000</span>12,805<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">8 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Reaver%27s_Fate\" title=\"The Reaver&#39;s Fate\">The Reaver's Fate</a></b>, Raid Warded chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shocking_Burst#Shocking_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shocking Burst\">Shocking Burst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shocking_Burst#Shocking_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shocking Burst\">Shocking Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in crackling electricity, and deals 1 to 6 electric damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 electric damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cloudburst_(effect)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloudburst (effect)\">Cloudburst</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cloudburst_(effect)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloudburst (effect)\">Cloudburst</a>:</b> On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal</a>, this weapon triggers a Cloudburst, striking its target with lightning and dealing sonic damage to surrounding enemies through a powerful thunderclap.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Stormreaver)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)\">Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Stormreaver)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)\">Upgradeable Item (Stormreaver)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Stormreaver\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Stormreaver\">Seal of the Stormreaver</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Stormreaver_Monument\" title=\"Stormreaver Monument\">Stormreaver Monument</a> in <a href=\"/page/Gianthold\" title=\"Gianthold\">Gianthold</a> and combine it with a Seal of the Stormreaver to upgrade the item to a more powerful form.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lightning_Strike\" title=\"Lightning Strike\"> Lightning Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Lightning_Strike\" title=\"Lightning Strike\"> Lightning Strike</a>:</b> This weapon stores the power of a volatile thunderstorm deep within. Occasionally, this dynamic power comes to the surface, devastating enemies with a massive lightning strike.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloudburst.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cloudburst.png/420px-Cloudburst.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"573\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloudburst.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Stormreaver_Monument\" title=\"Stormreaver Monument\">Stormreaver Monument</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This enormous blade was rumored to have belonged to the Stormreaver himself before his disappearance. It brims with static electricity.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Upgraded version:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloudburst_(upgraded).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloudburst_%28upgraded%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"472\" height=\"616\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816175453\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3620/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32914/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9444/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n136.62%  132.445     50 Template:IO\n100.00%   96.941      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   96.941      1 -total\n 97.10%   94.133      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 45.86%   44.459      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.03%   43.657      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 43.53%   42.195      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 42.49%   41.193      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.85%   22.153      8 Template:Popup\n 17.63%   17.092      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:7517-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816175453 and revision id 629070. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
